; A Gosub inside of For loops, whose limits are variables: the Return can come back into the middle of the loops.
n = 0
loop_limit = 3
For loop_i = 1 To loop_limit
	For loop_j = 1 To loop_limit Step 1
		Gosub increment
	Next
Next
Check "Gosub in nested For loops", n, 9

